{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/6ea503c7be0f9dbc45f59c1cf04414ec.avif?t=1762859787\" alt=\"About Momento\" width=600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momento is a cozy room decorator with a twist: the objects you choose will alter the course of the story! Decorate your room, choose which items are important to you, and discover how these choices play out over the course of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/2f79b4eea1c2a5788bde18341f1c1802.poster.avif?t=1762859787\" aria-label=\"Turning on lamps and adjusting picture frames\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/2f79b4eea1c2a5788bde18341f1c1802.webm?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/2f79b4eea1c2a5788bde18341f1c1802.mp4?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/6e6257b4eec374b7787505fd09dd6ab4.avif?t=1762859787\" alt=\"Multiple paths\" width=512 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin in childhood, picking out toys that represent your dreams for the future. Follow those dreams into adulthood, exploring wildly different settings and themes. Uncover stories of heartbreak, wonder and love, and learn the significance behind the sentimental treasures that follow you throughout. Pay close attention - some objects may be more than they seem at first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/0a667e4bed2064ce6f5cc8f2dac858a3.poster.avif?t=1762859787\" aria-label=\"Pating a cat on a window still\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/0a667e4bed2064ce6f5cc8f2dac858a3.webm?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/0a667e4bed2064ce6f5cc8f2dac858a3.mp4?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/f2e6de9896ae6f120bed351faf85c201.avif?t=1762859787\" alt=\"Your Choice\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click your way through a delightfully tactile world, switching on lights, leafing through books, petting adorable animals, and more! Collect items and furniture in story mode to play with in the endless creative mode. At the end of it all you return to the very beginning, to discover new endings, fresh twists in the path, and explore an evolving story of love and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/be39aa5e6295d8c1335332547b6ee8a1.poster.avif?t=1762859787\" aria-label=\"Straightening Picture frames on a wall\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/be39aa5e6295d8c1335332547b6ee8a1.webm?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/be39aa5e6295d8c1335332547b6ee8a1.mp4?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Embark on a journey where the objects you choose to keep influence the life you lead.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features:\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorative freedom: </strong>There\u2019s no right or wrong way to arrange your space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter: </strong>Watch small decisions ripple over a lifetime! <i>(Demo features the first 3 levels of Momento)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore freely: </strong>Search every nook and cranny of the level. There\u2019s surprises behind every corner!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative mode: </strong>Unlock items and furniture to decorate your own room in creative mode! <i>(Over 100+ items available in Demo)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easter eggs: </strong>Solve puzzles to uncover special rewards. (36 puzzle to discover)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous vibes: </strong>Immerse yourself in relaxing scenery and lovely music!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the developers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momento is the result of a collaboration between Jasmine Phillips (Art Lead), Jessica Lyon (Narrative Lead), and Julian Beiboer (Technical Lead), three developers based across two micro studios \u2013 Fat Alien Cat &amp; Nomo Studio \u2013 in Brisbane, Australia. Together, they\u2019re working to navigate the worlds of indie game development and parenthood.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4145800?t=1762859787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4145800?t=1762859787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/43fea83dab14fe2ecf47e334e9cb13f7b02598ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762859787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/43fea83dab14fe2ecf47e334e9cb13f7b02598ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762859787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/6ea503c7be0f9dbc45f59c1cf04414ec.avif?t=1762859787\" alt=\"About Momento\" width=600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momento is a cozy room decorator with a twist: the objects you choose will alter the course of the story! Decorate your room, choose which items are important to you, and discover how these choices play out over the course of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/2f79b4eea1c2a5788bde18341f1c1802.poster.avif?t=1762859787\" aria-label=\"Turning on lamps and adjusting picture frames\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/2f79b4eea1c2a5788bde18341f1c1802.webm?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/2f79b4eea1c2a5788bde18341f1c1802.mp4?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/6e6257b4eec374b7787505fd09dd6ab4.avif?t=1762859787\" alt=\"Multiple paths\" width=512 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin in childhood, picking out toys that represent your dreams for the future. Follow those dreams into adulthood, exploring wildly different settings and themes. Uncover stories of heartbreak, wonder and love, and learn the significance behind the sentimental treasures that follow you throughout. Pay close attention - some objects may be more than they seem at first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/0a667e4bed2064ce6f5cc8f2dac858a3.poster.avif?t=1762859787\" aria-label=\"Pating a cat on a window still\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/0a667e4bed2064ce6f5cc8f2dac858a3.webm?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/0a667e4bed2064ce6f5cc8f2dac858a3.mp4?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/f2e6de9896ae6f120bed351faf85c201.avif?t=1762859787\" alt=\"Your Choice\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click your way through a delightfully tactile world, switching on lights, leafing through books, petting adorable animals, and more! Collect items and furniture in story mode to play with in the endless creative mode. At the end of it all you return to the very beginning, to discover new endings, fresh twists in the path, and explore an evolving story of love and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/be39aa5e6295d8c1335332547b6ee8a1.poster.avif?t=1762859787\" aria-label=\"Straightening Picture frames on a wall\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/be39aa5e6295d8c1335332547b6ee8a1.webm?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/extras/be39aa5e6295d8c1335332547b6ee8a1.mp4?t=1762859787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Embark on a journey where the objects you choose to keep influence the life you lead.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features:\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorative freedom: </strong>There\u2019s no right or wrong way to arrange your space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter: </strong>Watch small decisions ripple over a lifetime! <i>(Demo features the first 3 levels of Momento)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore freely: </strong>Search every nook and cranny of the level. There\u2019s surprises behind every corner!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative mode: </strong>Unlock items and furniture to decorate your own room in creative mode! <i>(Over 100+ items available in Demo)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easter eggs: </strong>Solve puzzles to uncover special rewards. (36 puzzle to discover)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous vibes: </strong>Immerse yourself in relaxing scenery and lovely music!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the developers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momento is the result of a collaboration between Jasmine Phillips (Art Lead), Jessica Lyon (Narrative Lead), and Julian Beiboer (Technical Lead), three developers based across two micro studios \u2013 Fat Alien Cat &amp; Nomo Studio \u2013 in Brisbane, Australia. Together, they\u2019re working to navigate the worlds of indie game development and parenthood.</p>","developers":["Fat Alien Cat","Nomo Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2474770","name":"Momento"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145800/8e3d929ee20e2b48f5b2f1ed0c58bd443690b40e/header.jpg?t=1762859787","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Fat Alien Cat & Nomo Studio","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4145800/506949904/05f0d1f34aec9e60d629e3b97b1be5bcddc25cb9/1761738888/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762337086","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4145800/506949904/05f0d1f34aec9e60d629e3b97b1be5bcddc25cb9/1761738888/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762337086","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4145800/506949904/05f0d1f34aec9e60d629e3b97b1be5bcddc25cb9/1761738888/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762337086","id":257224121,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224121/movie480.mp4?t=1762337086","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224121/movie_max.mp4?t=1762337086"},"name":"Momento Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224121/7